. Formerly, the month of October was called \"Kannazuki\" (\"the month without gods\") but in Izumo, it is called \"Kamiarizuki\" (\"month of the gods\") because it is considered that during this time of the year , a myriad of deities gather for a pilgrimage to the city's sanctuary.\n\nAt the heart of this place lives Kanna, a young girl passionate about racing who suddenly loses all her motivation when her mother dies."},"tags":[{"name":"Mythology","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Youkai","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Outdoor Activities","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Animals","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Athletics","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gods","rank":40,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Child of Kamiari Month","english":"Child of Kamiari Month","native":"神在月のこども","romaji":"Kamiarizuki no Kodomo","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"神在月的孩子"}]},"trailer":{"id":"ZsTS1tsD2NM","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZsTS1tsD2NM/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}